@startuml SD04_Hysteresis
!include _style.iuml
title SD-04  Conditions fail and clear — safety decision (UC-10, UC-03) — REQ-03, REQ-37 … REQ-39, REQ-50

participant ":MonitorService" as Svc
participant ":SafetyDecisionEngine" as Eng
participant ":SafetyHysteresis" as Hys
participant ":ManualOverride" as Ovr
participant ":AllskySafetyMonitorDevice" as Dev
participant "NINA" as NINA

== A condition fails (cloud, rain, gust, stale data, error) ==
Svc -> Eng : Decide(snapshot[some condition failed])
Eng -> Hys : Reset()
Eng --> Svc : Unsafe, reason = failed conditions
Svc -> Ovr : Apply(status)
Svc -> Dev : SnapshotAvailable
Dev -> NINA : PropertyChanged(IsSafe = false)
note right : Immediate (REQ-38)

== Only undetermined failures (no usable image, cloud unknown, no current weather data) ==
alt UndeterminedIsSafe = false (default)
  Svc -> Eng : Decide(snapshot)
  Eng -> Hys : Reset()
  Eng --> Svc : Unsafe, reason = the undetermined conditions
else UndeterminedIsSafe = true
  Svc -> Eng : Decide(snapshot)
  Eng -> Hys : Apply(true, now, SafeAfterMin)
  Eng --> Svc : "Assumed safe: <reasons>: safe in 4:00", then Safe with Assumed = true
  note right : Panel shows SAFE (ASSUMED) in amber;\nthe decision log marks it (REQ-45, REQ-50).\nDetected cloud, rain and wind\nare never undetermined.
end

== Everything clear ==
loop each cycle while all conditions pass
  Svc -> Eng : Decide(snapshot[all passed])
  Eng -> Hys : Apply(true, now, SafeAfterMin)
  alt first clear cycle
    Hys -> Hys : clearSinceUtc = now
  end
  Hys --> Eng : safe = false, secondsToSafe
  Eng --> Svc : Unsafe, "All conditions clear: safe in 2:10"
end
note over Svc : The panel counts down between cycles\nfrom SecondsToSafe and TimestampUtc.

== SafeAfterMin [4] reached ==
Svc -> Eng : Decide(snapshot[all passed])
Eng -> Hys : Apply(true, now, SafeAfterMin)
Hys --> Eng : safe = true
Eng --> Svc : Safe, "All conditions clear"  (Untuned flag while untuned, REQ-43)
Svc -> Dev : SnapshotAvailable
Dev -> NINA : PropertyChanged(IsSafe = true)
note right : Only after SafeAfterMin (REQ-39)

== Idle or monitor error ==
Svc -> Eng : Decide(Idle snapshot, or error snapshot with no conditions)
note right : An error snapshot has no checks, so it is never\nassumed safe: nothing was checked, not even\nthat it is night.
Eng -> Hys : Reset()
Eng --> Svc : Idle / Unsafe  (countdown starts again afterwards)
note over Svc, Eng
  Decide works on snapshot.Conditions.Deciding(cloudDecidesSafety): with cloud
  advisory (the default) a stale image or detected cloud does not reset the countdown
  or make the status unsafe; the cloud result is shown as advice (REQ-28, REQ-45).
end note
@enduml
